+++++# Tasks
+++++
+++++Each task must name the criteria it satisfies, the files it touches, a line
+++++budget and an exit condition. G1 checks all four, and checks that every
+++++criterion in the spec is covered by at least one task.
+++++
+++++Add `- depends_on: T-1` where order matters. Tasks with no dependency on
+++++each other form a wave; `keel tasks` shows them.
+++++
+++++### T-1 A narrowed report carries the spec's blast radius
+++++- criteria: AC-1
+++++- files: _name the files this task touches_
+++++- budget: 25
+++++- exit: `cargo test --test report the_narrowed_report_carries_the_blast_radius` exits 0
+++++
+++++### T-2 The unnarrowed report stays free of it
+++++- criteria: AC-2
+++++- files: _name the files this task touches_
+++++- budget: 25
+++++- exit: `cargo test --test report blast_radius_is_absent_from_the_unnarrowed_report` exits 0
+++++
+++++### T-3 A missing symbol index degrades to null
