+++++- files: _name the files this task touches_
+++++- budget: 25
+++++- exit: `cargo test --test report blast_radius_is_null_without_a_symbol_index` exits 0
+++++
+++++### T-4 The depth matches the configured default
+++++- criteria: AC-4
+++++- files: _name the files this task touches_
+++++- budget: 25
+++++- exit: `cargo test --test report blast_radius_depth_matches_plan_blast_depth` exits 0
+++++
